	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『宇宙戦艦ヤマト2202』の地球艦隊の主力を成す地球連邦主力戦艦ドレッドノートがLEDユニットで輝く仕様で登場!",
			"• 精密なディテールを再現。",
			"• 同梱LEDユニット（青）で波動砲発射を再現。",
			"• 同梱LEDユニット（緑）で艦橋発光を再現可能。",
			"• 新規造形のコスモタイガーIIが4機付属。",
			"• 別売LED発光ユニット（白）でエンジンとサブエンジンの発光を再現可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The Earth Federation main battleship Dreadnought, which forms the main force of the Earth fleet in \"Space Battleship Yamato 2202,\" is now available with a glowing LED unit!",
			"• Reproduce precise details.",
			"• Reproduce the wave motion gun firing with the included LED unit (blue).",
			"• Bridge lighting can be reproduced with the included LED unit (green).",
			"• Includes 4 newly designed Cosmo Tiger IIs.",
			"• Light emission from the engine and sub-engine can be reproduced using the separately sold LED light emitting unit (white)."
		]
	},
